    "title": "Denver Broncos",
    "description": "Maximize your Broncos fandom by downloading the official mobile app of the Denver Broncos. Stay updated with breaking news, real-time stats, on-demand videos, and more on your phone or tablet, anytime and anywhere.\r\n\r\nApp features include: \r\n\r\nCustomizable Fan Profile\r\nTop 5 \u2013 Select your top five features for a more personalized experience. \r\nFavorite players \u2013 Create a favorite players list to gain quicker access to all media items that feature them. \r\nSaved media \u2013 Save media items for later, and come back to them when the time is convenient for you.  \r\n\r\nEasy-to-navigate content sections: \r\nConsume articles, videos, photos and podcasts when you want, how you want. Watch the latest video series or listen to the most recent episode of your favorite Broncos podcast.\r\n\r\nInformative Team Page \r\nRoster - Search the roster by player, number, or position.\r\n\r\nIndividual player pages \u2013 Use detailed player pages to track your favorite Broncos. \r\n\r\nTeam stats - Track the team's performance in one place.\r\n\r\nCoaches - Get to know our coaching staff and learn about their coaching history and achievements.\r\n\r\nDedicated Stadium Hub \r\nFind everything you need for a successful fan experience during gameday and stadium events, including an interactive stadium map, parking information, and ADA assistance, all in one place.\r\n\r\nFan Zone\r\n\r\nBroncos Country can easily access mobile wallpapers, enter contests and play games right from the home screen!\r\n\r\nMultiple Schedule Views\r\nEasily switch between a matchup view, a list view and a monthly view of the schedule.\r\n\r\nTicketing Help \r\nUse in-app ticketing guides to help you access and manage your mobile tickets.\r\n\r\nManage Your Notifications\r\n\r\nChoose which information you want to receive on your phone.\r\n\r\nFollow us @Broncos on Twitter for updates or visit http://www.denverbroncos.com/ . \r\n\r\nPlease note: This app features Nielsen's proprietary measurement software which contributes to market research, like Nielsen's TV Ratings. Please see https://priv-policy.imrworldwide.com/priv/mobile/us/en/optout.html for more information.",
